{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 416, "line_no": 29, "text": "人”把燃着的香头伸进早先已含起口水的嘴里，香“啾啾”直响，表示“仙人”正在吃“饭”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2012, "w": 1544, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "人”把燃着的香头伸进早先已含起口水的嘴里，香“啾啾”直响，表示“仙人”正在吃“饭”。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2012, "w": 1544, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 416, "line_no": 30, "text": "抹过汗，喝过茶、酒，吃过饭，侍者就为“仙人”找“伙伴”来对唱，听众中任何人都可以", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2080, "w": 1463, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "抹过汗，喝过茶、酒，吃过饭，侍者就为“仙人”找“伙伴”来对唱，听众中任何人都可以", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2080, "w": 1463, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 416, "line_no": 31, "text": "充当“伙伴”的角色进行对唱⋯⋯", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2148, "w": 579, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "充当“伙伴”的角色进行对唱⋯⋯", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2148, "w": 579, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 416, "line_no": 32, "text": "开始唱时一般都有几首比较固定的歌，而后就可即兴而唱⋯⋯", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2217, "w": 1089, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "开始唱时一般都有几首比较固定的歌，而后就可即兴而唱⋯⋯", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2217, "w": 1089, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
